Indented image and caption stay literal

```
 ![Apollo](a.jpg)
 ^ Figure 1: moon
.
<figure>
  <img src="a.jpg" alt="Apollo">
  <figcaption>Figure 1: moon</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
 {.gallery}
 ![Apollo](a.jpg)
 ^ Figure 1: moon
.
<figure class="gallery">
  <img src="a.jpg" alt="Apollo">
  <figcaption>Figure 1: moon</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
![Apollo](a.jpg)
^ Figure 1: moon
.
<figure>
  <img src="a.jpg" alt="Apollo">
  <figcaption>Figure 1: moon</figcaption>
</figure>
```
